WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.880
Which low-risk finding unlocks

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.230
your crown-jewel secret?

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:04.130
Wrong question.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:05.673
Ask which findings connect.

00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:06.718
Here, three hops

00:00:06.718 --> 00:00:07.763
reach the secret.

00:00:07.913 --> 00:00:09.168
A restricted account.

00:00:09.168 --> 00:00:10.423
A continuity token.

00:00:10.423 --> 00:00:12.097
Then privileged group impersonation.

00:00:12.247 --> 00:00:14.027
Offens AI reasons locally.

00:00:14.027 --> 00:00:15.362
Execution stays inside

00:00:15.362 --> 00:00:16.697
deterministic safety gates.

00:00:16.847 --> 00:00:18.319
The result: secret accessed.

00:00:18.319 --> 00:00:19.424
No persistent objects.

00:00:19.424 --> 00:00:20.897
Audit logs still apply.

00:00:21.047 --> 00:00:22.766
Don't prioritize a longer list.

00:00:22.766 --> 00:00:23.798
Break the chain

00:00:23.798 --> 00:00:24.830
that actually works.
